{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790970227,"nonce":"sVW9WEet9TzlC1yA9zkAQq2DjfI=","title":"Static properties of an abstract read nothing","message":"Row: Issue3554.\n\n`static_property_accessor` (ir/mir/helpers/globals.rs) finds the getter through\n`static_field_owners` -\u003e `class_method_by_name`, filled only for classes (decl/metadata.rs); the\nabstract branch in decl/module.rs fills `property_access_map` but not `static_field_owners`. A\n`(get, never)` static has no global, so the fallback finds nothing, the read is\n`[lower-none] variable a(Field, A.a)` and its statement silently vanishes.","files":null}]}